// CleEvent A discrete lifecycle event from the CLE specification (ECMA-428).
//
// CLE timestamps in TEA responses use the shared `date-time` schema: UTC with the
// `Z` designator, fractional seconds preserved. A `+00:00` offset in an upstream CLE
// document denotes the same instant and is re-expressed as `Z`. Any other offset is
// not UTC and is not valid CLE.
